{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102360","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102360","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1310236001:0":{"text":"“미지의 어둠”, “잊혀진 오래된 이야기”, “기이한 공간” ...와, 엄청나게 재미있을 것 같아요!","source_cn":"“未知和黑暗”、“遗忘已久的故事”、“奇诡的空间”……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FD50309F6D3A907","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310236002:0":{"text":"기사라면 당연히 이런 스릴 있는 종목에 도전해야죠!","source_cn":"身为骑士，就该挑战这种惊险刺激的项目！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC48462DFB653B1CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1310236002":{"text":"기사라면 당연히 이런 스릴 있는 종목에 도전해야죠!","source_cn":"身为骑士，就该挑战这种惊险刺激的项目！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC48462DFB653B1CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310236004:0":{"text":"전부 다 알려주면 재미없잖아요. 작은 서프라이즈를 남겨둬야 재미있죠!","source_cn":"要是我都告诉你们了，就很无聊了啊。当然要给你们留一些小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x497E4816FA7800DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310236005:0":{"text":"어서 가요, <style=\"highlight\">화이트 베어 온천 여관</style>에 도착하면 알게 될 거예요. 길을 따라 북서쪽으로 가서 다리를 건너면 금방 도착한답니다.","source_cn":"快去吧，到了<style=highlight>白熊温泉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F43DCDF7CC49EE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_r